    "body": "fix on mkinney:issue/299-wall-column-gouge · PR #481 · pinned by wall_slack (camcraft-sim: a_column_a_few_microns_inside_a_finished_wall_is_not_a_gouge, a_real_gouge_into_a_wall_still_convicts_at_its_full_depth, +3) and wall_column_gouge (camcraft-app: a_3d_finish_on_the_users_part_reads_no_gouge_at_its_wall, a_3d_finish_in_the_users_box_stock_reads_no_gouge_at_its_wall, the_issues_contour_on_model_stock_reads_no_gouge) · merges when reviewed. Note: the issue's exact contour repro no longer reproduces on main 5fd2b93; the 3D Finish variants did (10.21 mm on model stock; 37 cells / 22.01 mm in box stock) and are fixed. #303 is not fixed by this (sloped bevel, far past a 10 um slack).",
